        <mxCell id="sEoqBLB96bdYXDJqD-OZ-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Questions to ask:&lt;div&gt;1. Connected to mydb insert into diff db&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Insert into select - 100/1000 rows fails. What happens how to handle ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Do we maintain any log table, error table ?&lt;br&gt;What do we do ? How do we know ? rows inserted, failed in bronze layer, failed in silver&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. SCD1, 2 implemented after or before silver layer?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. DataType before of after bronze ? Why prehook ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Only 1 project on dbt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. all three(3) table under 1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
